        "da_id": "ES2011d.A.dialog-act.dharshi.288",
        "meeting_id": "ES2011d",
        "text": "So I guess we're supposed to write final reports .",
        "participant": "FEE041",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "ES2011d.A.dialog-act.dharshi.289",
        "meeting_id": "ES2011d",
        "text": "'Cause <disfmarker>",
        "participant": "FEE041",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "ES2011d.B.dialog-act.dharshi.195",
        "meeting_id": "ES2011d",
        "text": "All of us ?",
        "participant": "FEE042",
        "role": "ID"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "ES2011d.A.dialog-act.dharshi.290",
        "meeting_id": "ES2011d",
        "text": "I don't know . Hmm .",
        "participant": "FEE041",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "ES2011d.D.dialog-act.dharshi.218",
        "meeting_id": "ES2011d",
        "text": "Well there's al eight , nine .",
        "participant": "FEE044",
        "role": "ME"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "ES2011d.B.dialog-act.dharshi.194",
        "participant": "FEE042",
        "role": "ID",
        "text": "Especially if you have food ."
      },
      {
        "da_id": "ES2011d.C.dialog-act.dharshi.188",
        "participant": "FEE043",
        "role": "UI",
        "text": "<vocalsound>"
      }
    ],
    "peer_items": [
      {
        "item_key": "ES2011d#0",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "We decided on batteries, and the regular chip would be necessary for the more advanced iPod-like button."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "ES2011d#1",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "It's been a little bit difficult to ensure that it's hand-holdable and easy to use, without being too big."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "ES2011d#2",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "We can do the evaluation separately and then discuss it."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "ES2011d#3",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "The microphones are unreliable when moving to the whiteboard and could drop off if moved too much."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "ES2011d#4",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "The broccoli-shaped design is the preferred option."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "ES2011d#5",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "There is confusion about how to compute the average score—whether to sum the four scores and divide by four, and results vary."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "ES2011d#6",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "The product concept is satisfactory, fits the budget, and is trendy."
      }
    ],
